            "title": "Bigger/smaller",
            "id": 62373,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We can use comparisons to check if a number is less than or greater than another number.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Less than",
            "id": 62375,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To check if a number is less than another number, we use the <strong>less-than operator</strong>, <code>&lt;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To check if a number is less than another number, we use the <strong>less-than operator</strong>, <code>&lt;</code>.</p><p>Use <code>&lt;</code> to arrange the numbers into a comparison that displays <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>12</code>, followed by <code>&lt;</code>, and finally <code>90</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "True",
            "id": 62376,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If the number on the left is less than the number on the right, like in <code>1 &lt; 235</code>, the result is <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"235\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>1</code>, followed by <code>&lt;</code>, and finally <code>235</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If the number on the left is less than the number on the right, the result is <code>true</code>.</p><p>Use the less-than operator to make the code display <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"42\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"235\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>42</code>, followed by <code>&lt;</code>, and finally <code>235</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "False",
            "id": 64764,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If the number on the left isn't less than the number on the right, like in <code>235 &lt; 1</code>, the result is <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"235\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;</code>, followed by <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If the number on the left is not less than the number on the right, the result is <code>false</code>.</p><p>Use the less-than operator to make the code display <code>false</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"235\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>235</code>, followed by <code>&lt;</code>, and finally <code>8</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Greater than",
            "id": 62341,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To check if a number is greater than another number, we use the <strong>greater-than operator</strong>, <code>&gt;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"101\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To check if a number is greater than another number, we use the <strong>greater-than operator</strong>, <code>&gt;</code>.</p><p>Use <code>&gt;</code> to arrange the numbers into a comparison that displays <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"101\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>101</code>, followed by <code>&gt;</code>, and finally <code>12</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 62757,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What do we use the <code>&gt;</code> operator for?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">To check if a number is greater than another number</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">To check if a number is equal to another number</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">To check if a number is greater than another number.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>In <code>8 &gt; 3</code>, what does <code>&gt;</code> check?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Whether 8 is greater than 3.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Whether 8 is equal to 3.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Whether 8 is less than 3.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Whether 8 is greater than 3.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 62758,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What do we call the <code>&gt;</code> sign?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">The greater-than operator</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">The less-than operator</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The greater-than operator.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which operator makes <code>8 &gt; 3</code> evaluate to <code>true</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The greater-than operator</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">The less-than operator</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The equality operator</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick The greater-than operator.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 62759,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>You swap the two numbers in the comparison. What does the console display now?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>1</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
