            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Check if <code>30</code> is less than <code>40</code> with the less-than operator, <code>&lt;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"40\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>&lt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
