          {
            "title": " <=",
            "id": 62370,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To check if a number is less than or equal to another number, we use the <strong>less-than-or-equal-to operator</strong>, <code>&lt;=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To check if a number is less than or equal to another number, we use the <strong>less-than-or-equal-to operator</strong>, <code>&lt;=</code>.</p><p>Use <code>&lt;=</code> to arrange the numbers into a comparison that displays <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>1</code>, followed by <code>&lt;=</code>, and finally <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Check equality",
            "id": 62336,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If the number on the left is less than or equal to the number on the right, like in <code>11 &lt;= 11</code>, the result is <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>11</code>, followed by <code>&lt;=</code>, and finally <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>If the number on the left is less than or equal to the number on the right, the result is <code>true</code>. Make equal values log <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>11</code>, followed by <code>&lt;=</code>, and finally <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": ">=",
            "id": 62357,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To check if a number is greater than or equal to another number, we use the <strong>greater-than-or-equal-to operator</strong>, <code>&gt;=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"3099\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3099\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To check if a number is greater than or equal to another number, use the <strong>greater-than-or-equal-to operator</strong>, <code>&gt;=</code>.</p><p>Use <code>&gt;=</code> to arrange the numbers into a comparison that displays <code>true</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"3099\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"3000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>3099</code>, followed by <code>&gt;=</code>, and finally <code>3000</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Storing",
            "id": 62338,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To store the result of a comparison in a variable, we use the <code>=</code> sign. This is the <strong>assignment operator</strong>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To store a comparison result in a variable, use <code>=</code>. This is the assignment operator.</p><p>Store whether <code>1</code> is less than or equal to <code>15</code> in <code>result</code>, then display it.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>result</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, <code>&lt;=</code>, and finally <code>result</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Compare variables",
            "id": 62340,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We can also use a comparison operator to compare a variable with another variable, like in <code>min &lt;= max</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" min = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" max = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = min &lt;= max;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>min</code>, followed by <code>&lt;=</code>, and finally <code>max</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We can use a comparison operator to compare a variable with another variable.</p><p>Check whether <code>min</code> is less than or equal to <code>max</code>, keeping <code>min</code> on the left.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" min = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" max = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = min &lt;= max;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>min</code>, followed by <code>&lt;=</code>, and finally <code>max</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 1",
            "id": 62857,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which operator checks if a number is less than or equal to another number?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>&lt;=</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>&gt;=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which operator makes <code>7 ? 7</code> evaluate to <code>true</code> when the left value may be smaller or equal?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&lt;=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&gt;=</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 2",
            "id": 62858,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does the greater-than-or-equal-to operator, <code>&gt;=</code>, do?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">It checks if a number is greater than or equal to another number</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">It checks if a number is greater than another number</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It checks if a number is greater than or equal to another number.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When <code>score</code> is exactly <code>10</code>, what does <code>score &gt;= 10</code> evaluate to?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It depends on whether score is a variable.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 3",
            "id": 62859,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which operator do we use to check if a number on the left side of the statement is equal to or greater than <code>21</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&gt;=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The <code>&gt;=</code> operator checks whether the left value is equal to or greater than another value. A player passes with <code>21</code> points or more. Which operator completes <code>points ? 21</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>&gt;=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;=</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>&gt;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 62860,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The two values in this comparison are equal. What does the code display?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>10</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 62861,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Check if <code>batteryLevel</code> is less than or equal to <code>20</code> with the less-than-or-equal-to operator, <code>&lt;=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" batteryLevel = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" low = batteryLevel &lt;= \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Low battery: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + low);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"52\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Low battery: true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 62862,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Store the result of <code>points &gt;= 10</code> in the <code>levelTwo</code> variable.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" points = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelTwo = points &gt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level 2: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + levelTwo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Level 2: true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>=</code>, followed by <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Store whether <code>points</code> has reached level 2, then log the message.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" points = \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelTwo = points &gt;= \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level 2: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + levelTwo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Level 2: true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>levelTwo</code>, followed by <code>=</code>, <code>points</code>, and finally <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 62863,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Check if <code>solved</code> is less than or equal to <code>minimum</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" solved = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" minimum = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lostStreak = solved &lt;= minimum;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lostStreak);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>solved</code>, followed by <code>&lt;=</code>, and finally <code>minimum</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Check whether <code>solved</code> is at most <code>minimum</code>, then log the result.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" solved = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" minimum = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lostStreak = solved &lt;= minimum;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(lostStreak);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>solved</code>, followed by <code>&lt;=</code>, and finally <code>minimum</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 4",
            "id": 62864,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Check if <code>60</code> is greater than or equal to <code>50</code> with the greater-than-or-equal-to operator, <code>&gt;=</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt;= \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"17\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
